# Magic layout startup and resize smoke: the Tcl/TkX11 layout window must come
# up against the private Tcl/Tk plus libx11-compat stack, load the local fixture,
# and paint its scmos layer fills (green ndiffusion, red and brown diffusion) in
# quantity. It must then survive a top-level resize and re-render, exercising the
# libx11-compat ConfigureNotify and backing-texture resize path. The layer-color
# coverage assertion distinguishes a loaded layout from an empty-but-colorful
# magic grid window (which renders many colors but none of the layer fills); the
# changed-region assertion proves the resize caused a real re-render.
delay 1500
wait-window "magic" 15000
wait-converge 200 2 50 200 20000
screenshot initial
assert-image initial magic-layout-visible.json
resize 800 600
delay 300
wait-converge 200 2 50 200 20000
screenshot resized
assert-image resized magic-layout-resized.json
assert-exit running
